```html
<div>
  <mat-multiselect-list #list="matMultiselectList">
    <mat-option *ngFor="let item of items" [value]="item.value">{{ item.label }}</mat-option>
  </mat-multiselect-list>

  <button (click)="onSelectionChange(list.selectedOptions)">Submit Selections</button>
</div>
```

### Step 5: Run Your Application

Finally, run your application:

```bash
ng serve
```

This will start an Angular development server, and you should be able to see both the text editor and the multi-select list working together.

### Notes:
